{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026AHSlGxjfdc1794582669.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美股三大指數高開後個別發展，微軟全球服務故障，股價曾急跌逾百分之1。</p><p></p><p>道指早段升逾200點，曾經升至52,500點水平。納指略為高開後，反覆倒跌逾160點，回落至25,100點水平。</p><p></p><p>微軟股價曾經急跌約百分之1.7，跌至514美元水平有支持，跌幅逐步收窄。輝達再跌逾百分之2，輝達有持股的CoreWeave早段急挫約百分之9。AMD亦跌約百分之7。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T16:24:31.817969+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T15:09:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T18:59:41.943937+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T16:17:44.928848+00:00","content_hash":"724d33fc566a85d41d6d41d5e98948176646485a8ceec5e33782e845ba29d562","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}